* IBM 1401 AUTOCODER PROGRAM TO ADD TWO NUMBERS
* READ CARD INTO INPUT AREA
         READ   CARD,INPUT
* LOAD FIRST NUMBER
         LCA    NUM1,A
* ADD SECOND NUMBER
         A      NUM2,A
* STORE RESULT
         STO    A,RESULT
* WRITE OUTPUT
         WRITE  LINE,OUTPUT
* HALT PROGRAM
         H
* DATA AREAS
INPUT    DS     80
NUM1     DC     '00100'
NUM2     DC     '00200'
RESULT   DC     '00000'
OUTPUT   DS     132
CARD     DCW    INPUT,80
LINE     DCW    OUTPUT,132
         END
